    {"on": "the mind of the one strengthened and improved with tracing the deductions of reason", "text": "Cicero's real point: the life of the mind, 'tracing the deductions of reason', is happier than the life of power. It is the Pythagorean and Platonic view of the first sessions, in a Roman voice."}
